---
title: Bhindi ka Bhaji (stir fried okra)
servings: 2
time: 30 minutes
author: Vedant
---
Heat a pan to medium flame.

Pour enough @oil{} into the #pan -- make sure it does not smoke.

Sprinkle in some @jeera{} and wait until it sizzles.

Add the @frozen bhindi{} and stir fry on #high heat{} for a ~{few%minutes}.

Reduce to medium heat and toss around with a spatula.

Season with @salt{}, @haldi{1/3%tsp}, @laal mirchi{1/3%tsp}, and @dhaniya powder{1/2%tsp} to taste. Stir well.

Optionally, add @onion{1/2%cup} if desired.

Cook until the bhindi cuts cleanly -- this is your doneness test.



